   "codex_note": "Flags before the subcommand (`cargo +stable publish`, `npm --ignore-scripts publish`) are left to exec-guard's outward check, which parses the subcommand; a text rule for them also denied ordinary commands such as `cargo +nightly test --features publish` (Grok round 2, R2-4).",
   "codex_why": "Publishing is an operator action; check a release with `cargo package` or `npm pack --dry-run`."
  },
  {
   "id": "release",
