   "codex_why": "Creating or changing a release, or pushing tags, is an operator action. `gh release view` and `list` stay available.",
   "codex_note": "A bare tag name (`git push origin v1.2.3`), `refs/tags/` refspecs and `gh -R o/r release` are found by exec-guard: it resolves the refspec against the repository's tags."
